.\n\nCombined 20 candidates. This gives a balanced set of 操作记录 (reproducible methods) and 条件与原理 (cooking principles), which directly match the user's interest in 可复现做法 and 烹饪原理.\n\nLet me verify none of these are 市场观察 or 专题观察. All selected are either 操作记录 or 条件与原理. Good.\n\nLet me confirm the candidate IDs exist in the list. All these IDs appear in the candidates list.\n\nLet me now publish. I'll provide fact-grounded reasons for each.\n\nLet me create the plan and publish.\n\nActually, let me double check the working set count is 80 and I have all candidates. The candidates list provided has 80 items. I've selected 20 distinct ones.\n\nLet me publish the recommendations.\n\nLet me write reasons grounded in facts:\n- 操作记录 items: give ingredient amounts, processing order, heating intensity/time, batch comparisons, adjustment steps for over-dry/watery/undercooked. Relevant because user wants reproducible methods.\n- 条件与原理 items: explain how moisture, temperature, ingredient structure affect texture, compare treatment boundaries, explain what changes when substituting ingredients. Relevant because user wants cooking principles.\n\nLet me publish.","type":"text"},{"arguments":{"items":[{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-024e99402549","recommendationReason":"操作记录类内容给出煎饺的食材用量、处理次序与加热强度时间，并提供过干、出水或不熟时的调整步骤，直接对应你对可复现家常做法的关注。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-02ec789dd9bf","recommendationReason":"清汤调味的操作记录以家庭周末午餐为背景，记录用量、次序与批次口感比较，符合你关注可复现做法与食材处理的需求。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-085ac75e2f6f","recommendationReason":"煎豆腐的家庭周末午餐操作记录给出处理次序与加热控制，并提供过干、出水等问题的调整步骤，贴合家常烹饪的可复现做法诉求。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-1635bae1e58d","recommendationReason":"米饭含水量的操作记录关注加热强度、时间与批次口感比较，属于家常主食的食材处理范畴，契合你的烹饪兴趣。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-2062e507d111","recommendationReason":"蒸鱼的两人晚餐操作记录给出用量、处理次序与加热控制，并提供不熟等问题的调整步骤，是可复现的家常做法内容。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-2802591dd8c9","recommendationReason":"蔬菜焯水的工作日备餐操作记录涉及食材处理次序与加热时